WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.320
Welcome to Security Instructor’s Traffic Management & Vehicle
Control course.

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:20.280
A marshal coordinates vehicles and pedestrians within the site
plan and their authority. When the gate is busy, prioritise
pedestrians and coordinate with the gate team.

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:27.080
Choose a safe position where drivers can see you, and identify an
escape route before movement starts.

